  "question": {
    "text": "A string is stretched between fixed points separated by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>75</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math>. it is observed to have resonant frequency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>420</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>315</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>Hz</mi></math>. There are no other resonant frequencies between these two. Then, the lowest resonant frequency for this string is"
  },
